McpSignInRequest.description:
Sign in to a trusted OAuth server. Core prepares the sign-in and answers with the
authorization address; Main opens it in the system browser (https, or this computer only);
the browser's return completes the sign-in in Core.

oneOf.description:
A deletion that does not go to the Recycle Bin — a Shell command that
deletes files, or `fs.delete` asked to delete for good. Asked every time, never reused;
a Shell deletion in 完全访问 is not asked (its user was told when turning it on).
